      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>D\u012bw\u0101n al-\u02beIshr\u0101f (Office of supervision)</li>\n<li>Makhz\u016bma</li>\n<li>submitted by Mu\u1e25ammad b. \u02bfAl\u012b, the representative of the (sugar) factory and the house of honey at the press of....</li>\n<li>for pressing sugar cane, in the khar\u0101j\u012b year four hundred and ninety, what is pressed in</li>\n<li>the months of the khar\u0101j\u012b year four-hundred and ninety-one for the period beginning on</li>\n<li>Monday, the twenty-sixth of Barm\u016bd\u0101, and ending on Saturday, the first of Bashans of the aforementioned year.</li>\n<li>I testified to what this makhz\u016bma contains and what ...[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ]... and its amount,</li>\n<li>[&nbsp; &nbsp; ] the aforementioned amounts of its fine sugar. Written by \u02bfAl\u012b b, al-\u1e24asan b. \u02bfAl\u012b in Rajab of the year four hundred and ninety-five</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
